    <string name="aboutMainText">"This started as a java program years ago, and seemed like a good concept for learning Android. As you can see, I learned more about app functionality than design… I don't know how much time I'll dedicate to improvements, but if you have suggestions please send me an email. Thanks for giving ScopeSighter a try! 

PS If there are any Android/Web UI people out there looking for a portfolio project…I know a guy who could use you."</string>
