    <string name="dialogBodyText">"1) Click the \"Scope And Range Manager\" Button 
2) Enter the info for your scope and range
3) Put down your phone, and shoot a grouping
4) Press the \"New Session\" button
5) Tap on the screen to match your paper target
6) Press \"Display Results,\" make the adjustments, and repeat as necessary!"</string>
